<title>UK: Transco awards storage tender at 9.45 p/th.</title>
<headline>Transco awards storage tender at 9.45 p/th.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transco, the pipeline and storage arm of BG plc, has awarded its storage tender to 17 companies at an average price of 0.3223 pence per kiloWatt hour (9.45 pence a therm), the company said on Monday.</p>
<p>Transco offered for sale 4,713 GigaWatt hours (Gwh) of gas in storage which it said was surplus to current Margins and Top-Up requirements.</p>
<p>It received bids from 27 users for &quot;comfortably in excess&quot; of this volume. The award was made at an average price of 9.45 pence a therm and a strike price of 0.3054 pence a kiloWatt hour (8.95 pence a therm), Transco said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 6412</p>
